IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PDA-SPEC-BRANCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CANDIDATE-LEN       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BRANCH-DEPTH        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FIDELITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PDA-BRANCH.
    IF CANDIDATE-LEN == 0 OR BRANCH-DEPTH == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 3480 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    MOVE 100 TO FIDELITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CANDIDATE-LEN.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
